{"id":"r4-d89d7d","status":"read","groups":[{"saying":1,"saying_opens":"حرم من النسب سبع","levels":[[{"surface":"أحمد بن حنبل","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"يحيى بن سعيد","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"سفيان","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"حبيب","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"سعيد","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"ابن عباس","kind":"narrator"}]]},{"saying":3,"saying_opens":"إذا زنى بأخت امرأته","levels":[[{"surface":"عكرمة","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"ابن عباس","kind":"narrator","occurrence":2}]]},{"saying":4,"saying_opens":"فيمن يلعب بالصبي إن أدخله فيه","levels":[[{"surface":"يحيى الكندي","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"الشعبي","kind":"narrator"},{"surface":"أبي جعفر","kind":"narrator"}]]},{"saying":5,"saying_opens":"إذا زنى بها لم تحرم عليه امرأته","levels":[[{"surface":"عكرمة","kind":"narrator","occurrence":2}],[{"surface":"ابن عباس","kind":"narrator","occurrence":3}]]},{"saying":6,"saying_opens":"أن ابن عباس حرمه","levels":[[{"surface":"أبو نصر","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"ابن عباس","kind":"narrator","occurrence":4}]]},{"saying":7,"saying_opens":"لا تحرم حتى يلزق بالأرض","levels":[[{"surface":"أبو هريرة","kind":"narrator"}]]},{"saying":8,"saying_opens":"لا تحرم","levels":[[{"surface":"الزهري","kind":"narrator","occurrence":3}],[{"surface":"علي","kind":"narrator"}]]}],"shared_tail":null,"needs_ruling":false,"notes":["Bukhari's chapter gathers many sayings on the same question, each with or without its own isnad (rule 4a). Only sayings with a named transmitter are written. Bare opinions of Ibn Sirin, al-Hasan, Jabir ibn Zayd and the others, and the list «عمران بن حصين وجابر بن زيد والحسن وبعض أهل العراق» and «جوزه ابن المسيب وعروة والزهري», are not written as groups here: the list is a remark about a ruling, not a route.","«وهذا مرسل» is the compiler's note."],"fixes":[]}
